Use _strnicmp for strncasecmp on Windows

With recent mingw-w64, mapping strncasecmp to strnicmp ends up calling
itself, and GCC compiles token_string_casecmp() into an endless loop.
Any UPnP device on the network then keeps a discovery thread spinning
and VLC can never quit.

--- a/upnp/src/inc/uri.h
+++ b/upnp/src/inc/uri.h
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #ifdef _WIN32
-	#define strncasecmp strnicmp
+	#define strncasecmp _strnicmp
 #else
 	/* Other systems have strncasecmp */
 #endif
